# Narys V1 specification

Status: Draft for product owner review. Conformance cases describe planned checks.

Scope: One selected area of one existing GitHub repository per pilot. An operator can opt in to public read-only access for a workspace backed by a public GitHub repository. The Narys launch uses that setting.

The V1 map supports automatic analysis and evidence inspection. Manual map corrections are deferred. [V1 map scope](docs/requirements/v1-automated-map.md#deferred-scope)

Approval: Pending joint review of the specification and engineering baseline.

## 1. Purpose and sources

Narys lets engineers understand architectural changes as they merge. Once a maintainer configures the workspace, Narys generates the starting map and publishes changes automatically. The workspace ties claims to the underlying code and available rationale, with deployment recorded separately. [V1 release scope](docs/requirements/product.md#8-release-scope) · [Automated map requirement](docs/requirements/v1-automated-map.md)

